ed loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176450/extras/128ebf353699dc6b3f1b807b4ce7a9ed.poster.avif?t=1754336470\" width=612 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176450/extras/128ebf353699dc6b3f1b807b4ce7a9ed.webm?t=1754336470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176450/extras/128ebf353699dc6b3f1b807b4ce7a9ed.mp4?t=1754336470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Help Eva collect all the coins and keys to open the door to an exciting world of adventure! Join Eva Platformer game and prove that you are a real platformer lover!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176450/extras/0e9c2ffe664401c76fe08032de8136cd.poster.avif?t=1754336470\" width=612 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176450/extras/0e9c2ffe664401c76fe08032de8136cd.webm?t=1754336470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176450/extras/0e9c2ffe664401c76fe08032de8136cd.mp4?t=1754336470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
